{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c131214-f0b5-808a-aaed-430afcc6dae5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T11:59:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam H. McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth, good afternoon! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. Sorry, I am going to talk very quiet, I have a baby sleeping right here in the room. [pause] Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, no problem at all. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. I am calling about the skating area. The one at the beach park. Is it open right now? Because I see online some things but no way I can tell if it is current."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me check. Which park were you thinking of, the one by the beach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:57:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the beach park, the one with the skating area near the water. I am not sure the name exactly. I think it is the main one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Give me one second, I'm pulling up the notes from this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, no problem. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So right now the skating area is listed as closed. With the cold we've had and the ice on the surface, the crew has it shut until it's safe. They check it daily."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, closed. Okay. No way I am going to bring my nephew, then. He is nine and he wants to go so bad, he asks me every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet he does. Yeah, I'd hold off for now. If the weather warms up and dries things out, they'll update it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:58:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, do I need to call again to find out? Like a follow-up call, or is there a place where it changes by itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say yes, a follow-up call is the surest way. Give us a ring tomorrow morning or later in the week and whoever picks up can read you the latest status. The website can lag behind a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is good to know. So I call again, maybe Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday is a good bet. We'll have had a couple more daily checks by then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you very much, Beth. Sorry again for the whisper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't apologize, you did great. Enjoy the rest of your day, and good luck with the little one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye bye."
    }
  ],
